| `paper_position` | 300 | Portfolio-aware features |

Freshness state machine emits `CURRENT | STALE | MISSING` (enum at service.py:555-559). Stale entries populate `stale_feature_flags`; missing entries populate `missing_feature_flags`. Both surface in `v2:features:latest:{SYM}:{TF}` snapshot wrapper.

## 8. NULLABILITY SUMMARY

| Pattern | Legacy | V2 |
|---------|--------|-----|
| Missing input source | field absent (no NULL sentinel) | same — `if X is not None: features[K] = ...` |
| Failed computation (e.g. `len(closes) < 30`) | field absent | same — None upstream, omitted in writer |
| Stale-but-available | written; staleness in `*_staleness_ms` sidecar | written; `stale_feature_flags` list at snapshot level |
| Type errors in float coercion | field absent (try/except) | same (service.py:355-358) |

Both pipelines use **absence as the missing-value sentinel**. Consistent.

